<title>USA: Grove City Area SD, Pa., adjusted NIC.</title>
<headline>Grove City Area SD, Pa., adjusted NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Grove City Area School District, Pa., said on Wednesday it recalculated First Union Capital Market's winning bid on the District's $5 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the net interest cost was 5.0253 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 4.97 percent originally calculated.</p>
